&曹操\n军师所言极是。"]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":1,"offset":5752,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":5777,"body_end":5941,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[20]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&荀彧\n关于战场的地形，\n宛城四周有高山环绕。\n&曹操\n没有平坦的地形吗？\n&荀彧\n与城墙相邻的部份稍微平坦些，\n其他地方只有狭窄的小径。\n&曹操\n小径……？"]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":2,"offset":5941,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":5966,"body_end":6032,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[16]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&典韦\n主公，\n我一定要张绣为上次的冒失付出代价！"]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":3,"offset":6032,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":6057,"body_end":6557,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[21]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&程昱\n贾诩的举动令人关切，\n刘表的动向也是如此。\n&曹操\n嗯。"]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":6126,"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[1677],[]]},"end":5,"end_off":6549},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&程昱\n對了，上场战斗中所缴获的“传国玉玺”，\n可是主公的洪福啊……\n&曹操\n想想当年的秦始皇，还有现在的孙策小儿，\n哎！不知道这个玉玺在以后还会发生什么。\n&程昱\n这正是可以向天下炫耀的好机会，\n这是天命啊！\n&曹操\n军师想让我也成为袁术么？\n&程昱\n……当然不是，我的意思是\n这个玉玺在战斗中可以发挥巨大的作用。\n&曹操\n什么作用？\n&程昱\n由于它可以鼓舞士兵的士气，\n所以造成每回合致命一击。\n&曹操\n啊……可真是好玩意。"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":4,"offset":6557,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":6582,"body_end":6623,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[24]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"o